scene words.esn
window 160 90

# What a pass does, a scene's kernel says by the same words: the air laid
# over by `hazed` is the haze pass's picture, to the rounding two Kernels
# may each do their own way, which the air does change.
frame 0.0
expect apart_all.result[0] < 0.00001
expect apart_all.result[1] > 0.05

# Ink kept to the right half: the left as it was, the right the outline's,
# which does ink the stand.
expect apart_all.result[2] < 0.000001
expect apart_all.result[3] < 0.00001
expect apart_all.result[4] > 0.1
